-| G5 | pass | shipping density estimate 0/200,000; reference 2,614,000 operations in 0.073 s; strongest failing attack 0/256 restarts in 0.00086 s |
-| G6 | pass | five attacks each 0/8; reference DP 8/8 as expected |
-| G7 | pass | doubled dimension and fixed-answer-length escalation both build and verify |
