-This generator uses the objects of Dominik Scheder’s paper [*Using a Skewed Hamming Distance to Speed Up Deterministic Local Search*](https://arxiv.org/abs/1005.4874). A solver is handed a center in a Cartesian power of the directed color cycle and a radius, and must give the exact number of assignments at that directed distance. It may return the integer or a bounded sum of products of binomial coefficients. Checking is exact: the expression is evaluated and compared with an independent integer dynamic program.
 
-## Trust and hardness claim
