The three oracle arms are complete: bare `0/3`, structural `1/3`, placebo `0/3`. That supports the intended “discover the invariant” interpretation without changing the main hardened verdict. One final audit found that the canonicalization test covered cyclic color shifts but not the other three-color relabelings; since every permutation of three colors is affine over GF(3), I’m extending G8 to test independent multipliers as well as shifts before freezing the reports.
